[00:22.35]ka...
[00:24.74]kahe ko kahe ko kahe kau
[00:27.13]kaalaa kaagad kaalee kalam
[00:29.52]kaal likhe kaal mitaave
[00:31.91]kaa kaa arth na jaane koi
[00:34.31]kaa...
[00:36.70]kaaa...
[00:39.09]kaahe kaahe kaahe re kaa
[00:41.48]ka kha ga gha – sab teraa khel
[00:43.87]khaali kaagar kaahe bulaave
[00:46.26]kaam krodh kaa maare mel
[00:48.65]kyaa...
[00:51.05]ka kau ke
[00:53.44]ka se kau – teeno taar
[00:55.83]ken kabhyaam – dohraa dvaar
[00:58.22]kai kahe kai baar
[01:00.61]kaa ke beech mein kaun karaar
[01:03.00]ken kabhyaam kai
[01:05.39]kavim kaviim kavayah
[01:07.79]kavi bhi kya jaane kaa kaa arth
[01:10.18]kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:12.57]kahaam katham kathaam
[01:14.96]kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:17.35]katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:19.74]kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:22.13]kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:24.53]kasmin kyo keshu
[01:26.92]kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:29.31]keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:31.70]kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[01:34.09]kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[01:36.48]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[01:38.87]rahasya nahi to raaj hai kaala
[01:41.27]kaal kaa kaam hai khel dikhaana
[01:43.66]ka kaa arth hai kaal bhulaana
[01:46.05]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[01:48.44]nai bramaand racha daalaa
[01:50.83]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[01:53.22]naanak bhi ka kaa kahe gaye
[01:55.61]kaa kaa uttar kaal se gaye
[01:58.01]maatvaale ko kaun sambhaale
[02:00.40]kaa kaa chakkar kaal nivaale
[02:02.79]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:05.18]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:07.57]kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:09.96]kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:12.35]karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:14.75]kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:17.14]kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:19.53]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:21.92]sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:24.31]bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[02:26.70]kaal jo pahichaan liya
[02:29.09]ka kaa rahasya aap hi aaya
[02:31.49]chanddalaa de dna nai
[02:33.88]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[02:36.27]dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[02:38.66]kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[02:41.05]ka kaa bina kaal kaa raaj
[02:43.44]ka kaa mile to kaal ka kaaj
[02:45.83]ka kau ke
[02:48.23]ken kabhyaam kai
[02:50.62]kavim kaviim kavayah
[02:53.01]kahaam katham kathaam
[02:55.40]kasmin kyo keshu
[02:57.79]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[03:00.18]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[03:02.57]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[03:04.97]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[03:07.36]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[03:09.75]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[03:12.14]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[03:14.53]chanddalaa de dna nai
[03:16.92]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[03:19.31]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[03:21.71]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[03:24.10]khalq khuda kufr karam
[03:26.49]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[03:28.88]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:31.27]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:33.66]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:36.05]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:38.45]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[03:40.84]qazi kahe qabar chale
[03:43.23]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[03:45.62]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[03:48.01]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[03:50.40]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[03:52.79]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[03:55.19]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[03:57.58]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[03:59.97]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[04:02.36]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[04:04.75]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[04:07.14]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[04:09.53]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:11.93]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:14.32]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:16.71]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:19.10]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:21.49]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:23.88]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:26.27]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:28.67]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:31.06]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:33.45]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
